INSERT INTO `schemes` VALUES 
(1,'aadhaar','Aadhaar Enrolment and Updates','aadhaar','UIDAI publishes the current Aadhaar enrolment and update services, forms, and acceptable-document lists. The documents and steps depend on the service and applicant type, so check UIDAI guidance for the exact request. UIDAI Aadhaar Seva Kendras offer enrolment and update services.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://uidai.gov.in/en/enrolment-and-updates','[\"aadhaar\", \"aadhar\", \"uidai\", \"aadhaar card\", \"aadhaar update\", \"enrolment\", \"आधार\", \"आधार कार्ड\", \"आधार अपडेट\", \"aadhaar me sudhar\", \"aadhar update\"]','en',1,'2026-11-07 11:16:05','2026-11-07 12:44:14','Aadhaar Enrolment aur Updates','UIDAI current Aadhaar enrolment aur update services, forms, aur acceptable-document lists publish karta hai. Documents aur steps service aur applicant type par depend karte hain, isliye apni request ke liye UIDAI ki exact guidance check karein. UIDAI Aadhaar Seva Kendras par enrolment aur update services deta hai.',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(2,'aadhaar','आधार नामांकन और अपडेट','aadhaar','UIDAI आधार नामांकन और अपडेट सेवाओं, फॉर्म तथा स्वीकार्य दस्तावेज़ों की वर्तमान जानकारी देता है। दस्तावेज़ और चरण सेवा तथा आवेदक के प्रकार के अनुसार बदल सकते हैं, इसलिए अपने अनुरोध के लिए UIDAI की सूची देखें। UIDAI आधार सेवा केंद्र नामांकन और अपडेट सेवाएँ देते हैं।',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://uidai.gov.in/en/enrolment-and-updates','[\"aadhaar\", \"aadhar\", \"uidai\", \"aadhaar card\", \"aadhaar update\", \"enrolment\", \"आधार\", \"आधार कार्ड\", \"आधार अपडेट\", \"aadhaar me sudhar\", \"aadhar update\"]','hi',1,'2026-11-07 11:16:05','2026-11-07 12:44:14',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(3,'pan_card','PAN Card and PAN Services','pan_card','The Income Tax Department publishes current PAN allotment forms and PAN-related services. For a new PAN allotment application filed on or after 1 April 2026, the Department says to use the forms prescribed under the Income Tax Rules, 2026. Existing valid PANs remain valid; check the official page for the current form and service before applying.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.incometax.gov.in/iec/foportal/help/all-topics/e-filing-services/income-tax-forms','[\"pan\", \"pan card\", \"pan-card\", \"permanent account number\", \"pan 2.0\", \"new pan\", \"पैन\", \"पैन कार्ड\", \"pan banwana\", \"pan apply\", \"pan application\"]','en',1,'2026-11-07 11:16:05','2026-11-07 12:44:14','PAN Card aur PAN Services','Income Tax Department current PAN allotment forms aur PAN-related services publish karta hai. 1 April 2026 ya uske baad file ki gayi new PAN allotment application ke liye Department ke mutabik Income Tax Rules, 2026 ke prescribed forms use karein. Existing valid PAN valid rehte hain. Apply karne se pehle current form aur service official page par check karein.',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(4,'pan_card','पैन कार्ड और पैन सेवाएँ','pan_card','आयकर विभाग पैन आवंटन के वर्तमान फॉर्म और पैन से जुड़ी सेवाओं की जानकारी देता है। 1 अप्रैल 2026 या उसके बाद नए पैन के लिए आवेदन करते समय विभाग के अनुसार आयकर नियम, 2026 में निर्धारित फॉर्म इस्तेमाल करें। मौजूदा वैध पैन वैध रहते हैं; आवेदन से पहले वर्तमान फॉर्म और सेवा की आधिकारिक जानकारी देखें।',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.incometax.gov.in/iec/foportal/help/all-topics/e-filing-services/income-tax-forms','[\"pan\", \"pan card\", \"pan-card\", \"permanent account number\", \"pan 2.0\", \"new pan\", \"पैन\", \"पैन कार्ड\", \"pan banwana\", \"pan apply\", \"pan application\"]','hi',1,'2026-11-07 11:16:05','2026-11-07 12:44:14',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(5,'ration_card','Ration Card and State/UT Food Portals','ration_card','Under the National Food Security Act, the State or Union Territory government identifies eligible households and handles AAY and Priority Household ration-card issuance. Eligibility criteria and application procedures are state-specific. Use the NFSA apply page to select your State/UT food portal; do not assume a single national document list or process.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://nfsa.gov.in/portal/apply','[\"ration card\", \"ration\", \"rashan card\", \"rashan\", \"food security\", \"nfsa\", \"राशन कार्ड\", \"राशन\", \"rashan card ke liye\", \"ration card apply\"]','en',1,'2026-11-07 11:16:05','2026-11-07 12:44:14','Ration Card aur State/UT Food Portals','National Food Security Act ke under State ya Union Territory government eligible households identify karti hai aur AAY aur Priority Household ration cards issue karti hai. Eligibility criteria aur application process har State/UT mein alag ho sakte hain. NFSA apply page par apna State/UT Food Portal choose karein; ek hi national document list ya process assume na karein.',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(6,'ration_card','राशन कार्ड और राज्य/केंद्रशासित प्रदेश पोर्टल','ration_card','राष्ट्रीय खाद्य सुरक्षा अधिनियम के अंतर्गत पात्र परिवारों की पहचान और AAY तथा प्राथमिकता परिवार राशन कार्ड जारी करने का काम संबंधित राज्य या केंद्रशासित प्रदेश सरकार करती है। पात्रता और आवेदन प्रक्रिया राज्य के अनुसार अलग होती है। NFSA के आवेदन पृष्ठ से अपना राज्य/केंद्रशासित प्रदेश चुनें; एक ही राष्ट्रीय दस्तावेज़ सूची या प्रक्रिया मानकर न चलें।',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://nfsa.gov.in/portal/apply','[\"ration card\", \"ration\", \"rashan card\", \"rashan\", \"food security\", \"nfsa\", \"राशन कार्ड\", \"राशन\", \"rashan card ke liye\", \"ration card apply\"]','hi',1,'2026-11-07 11:16:05','2026-11-07 12:44:14',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(7,'pm_kisan','PM-KISAN Samman Nidhi','pm_kisan','PM-KISAN is a Central Sector scheme that provides ₹6,000 per year in three equal instalments to eligible landholding farmer families, subject to the scheme’s exclusion categories. State/UT governments identify eligible families. The official portal provides registration, beneficiary-status, and current e-KYC information; check it for your case.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://pmkisan.gov.in/','[\"pm kisan\", \"pm-kisan\", \"pmkisan\", \"pm kisaan\", \"kisan samman nidhi\", \"pm kisan status\", \"पीएम किसान\", \"पीएम-किसान\", \"किसान सम्मान निधि\", \"pm kisan ka paisa\"]','en',1,'2026-11-07 11:16:05','2026-11-07 12:44:14','PM-KISAN Samman Nidhi','PM-KISAN ek Central Sector scheme hai jo scheme ki exclusion categories ke adheen eligible landholding farmer families ko har saal ₹6,000 teen barabar instalments mein deti hai. State/UT governments eligible families identify karti hain. Registration, beneficiary status, aur current e-KYC information ke liye official portal check karein.',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(8,'pm_kisan','पीएम-किसान सम्मान निधि','pm_kisan','पीएम-किसान केंद्र क्षेत्र की योजना है। योजना की अपवर्जन श्रेणियों के अधीन पात्र भूमिधारक किसान परिवारों को सालाना ₹6,000 तीन समान किस्तों में दिए जाते हैं। पात्र परिवारों की पहचान राज्य/केंद्रशासित प्रदेश सरकारें करती हैं। पंजीकरण, लाभार्थी स्थिति और वर्तमान e-KYC जानकारी के लिए आधिकारिक पोर्टल देखें।',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://pmkisan.gov.in/','[\"pm kisan\", \"pm-kisan\", \"pmkisan\", \"pm kisaan\", \"kisan samman nidhi\", \"pm kisan status\", \"पीएम किसान\", \"पीएम-किसान\", \"किसान सम्मान निधि\", \"pm kisan ka paisa\"]','hi',1,'2026-11-07 11:16:05','2026-11-07 12:44:14',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(9,'scholarship','Government Scholarships on NSP','scholarship','The National Scholarship Portal lists participating scholarship schemes with scheme-specific eligibility, FAQs, and application timelines. Conditions, required details, and dates are not the same for every scholarship. Check the selected scheme’s current guidelines on NSP before applying.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://scholarships.gov.in/Students','[\"scholarship\", \"scholarships\", \"national scholarship portal\", \"nsp\", \"student aid\", \"chhatravritti\", \"छात्रवृत्ति\", \"स्कॉलरशिप\", \"scholarship kaise milegi\"]','en',1,'2026-11-07 11:16:05','2026-11-07 12:44:14','NSP par Government Scholarships','National Scholarship Portal par participating scholarship schemes ki alag eligibility, FAQs, aur application timelines milti hain. Conditions, required details, aur dates har scholarship ke liye same nahi hoti. Apply karne se pehle NSP par selected scheme ki current guidelines check karein.',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(10,'scholarship','NSP पर सरकारी छात्रवृत्तियाँ','scholarship','राष्ट्रीय छात्रवृत्ति पोर्टल पर उपलब्ध छात्रवृत्ति योजनाओं की योजना-विशिष्ट पात्रता, FAQ और आवेदन समय-सारणी दी जाती है। हर छात्रवृत्ति की शर्तें, आवश्यक जानकारी और तारीखें अलग हो सकती हैं। आवेदन से पहले NSP पर चुनी गई योजना के वर्तमान दिशा-निर्देश देखें।',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://scholarships.gov.in/Students','[\"scholarship\", \"scholarships\", \"national scholarship portal\", \"nsp\", \"student aid\", \"chhatravritti\", \"छात्रवृत्ति\", \"स्कॉलरशिप\", \"scholarship kaise milegi\"]','hi',1,'2026-11-07 11:16:05','2026-11-07 12:44:14',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(11,'general_scheme','Find Government Services on the National Portal','general_scheme','The National Portal of India has a Services section for searching government services and browsing them by category. Start there, then follow the linked ministry, department, or State/UT portal for the service you need. Requirements and processing are set by the responsible department.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.india.gov.in/services','[\"government services\", \"government service\", \"govt services\", \"government scheme\", \"government schemes\", \"scheme\", \"schemes\", \"yojana\", \"national portal\", \"india.gov.in\", \"central service\", \"state service\", \"सरकारी सेवाएँ\", \"सरकारी सेवा\", \"सरकारी योजना\", \"योजना\", \"भारत सरकार पोर्टल\", \"sarkari seva\"]','en',1,'2026-11-07 11:16:05','2026-11-07 12:46:28','National Portal par Government Services','National Portal of India ke Services section mein government services search aur category ke hisaab se browse kar sakte hain. Wahan se apni service ke linked ministry, department, ya State/UT portal par jayein. Requirements aur processing responsible department decide karta hai.',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(12,'general_scheme','राष्ट्रीय पोर्टल पर सरकारी सेवाएँ खोजें','general_scheme','भारत के राष्ट्रीय पोर्टल पर सरकारी सेवाएँ खोजने और श्रेणी के अनुसार देखने का Services अनुभाग है। वहाँ से शुरू करें और अपनी सेवा के लिए संबंधित मंत्रालय, विभाग या राज्य/केंद्रशासित प्रदेश पोर्टल खोलें। आवश्यकताएँ और प्रक्रिया संबंधित विभाग तय करता है।',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.india.gov.in/services','[\"government services\", \"government service\", \"govt services\", \"government scheme\", \"government schemes\", \"scheme\", \"schemes\", \"yojana\", \"national portal\", \"india.gov.in\", \"central service\", \"state service\", \"सरकारी सेवाएँ\", \"सरकारी सेवा\", \"सरकारी योजना\", \"योजना\", \"भारत सरकार पोर्टल\", \"sarkari seva\"]','hi',1,'2026-11-07 11:16:05','2026-11-07 12:46:28',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(13,'passport','Passport Seva','general_scheme','The Ministry of External Affairs Passport Seva portal explains fresh-passport and reissue applications. Its published process includes online registration, completing and submitting the application, paying the applicable service fee, booking an appointment, and visiting a PSK or POPSK with the documents listed for that service. Fees and document lists depend on the service; check the current official advisory.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://passportindia.gov.in/psp/apply','[\"passport\", \"passport seva\", \"passport application\", \"fresh passport\", \"passport reissue\", \"passport appointment\", \"पासपोर्ट\", \"पासपोर्ट सेवा\", \"passport kaise banaye\"]','en',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14','Passport Seva','Ministry of External Affairs ka Passport Seva portal fresh passport aur reissue applications ki process batata hai. Published process mein online registration, application complete karke submit karna, applicable service fee pay karna, appointment book karna, aur listed documents ke saath PSK ya POPSK visit karna shamil hai. Fees aur document list service par depend karte hain; current advisory check karein.',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(14,'passport','पासपोर्ट सेवा','general_scheme','विदेश मंत्रालय का पासपोर्ट सेवा पोर्टल नए पासपोर्ट और पुनः जारी करने की प्रक्रिया बताता है। प्रकाशित प्रक्रिया में ऑनलाइन पंजीकरण, आवेदन भरना और जमा करना, लागू सेवा शुल्क देना, अपॉइंटमेंट लेना तथा सेवा के लिए सूचीबद्ध दस्तावेज़ों के साथ PSK या POPSK जाना शामिल है। शुल्क और दस्तावेज़ सेवा के अनुसार बदलते हैं; वर्तमान आधिकारिक जानकारी देखें।',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://passportindia.gov.in/psp/apply','[\"passport\", \"passport seva\", \"passport application\", \"fresh passport\", \"passport reissue\", \"passport appointment\", \"पासपोर्ट\", \"पासपोर्ट सेवा\", \"passport kaise banaye\"]','hi',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(15,'voter_services','Election Commission Voter Services','general_scheme','The Election Commission of India’s citizen portal supports new voter registration, electoral-roll search, application tracking, and requests to correct or update entries. The form depends on the request, so use the portal’s current form guidance rather than a general checklist.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://voters.eci.gov.in/','[\"voter\", \"voter id\", \"voter registration\", \"voter card\", \"electoral roll\", \"epic\", \"eci\", \"मतदाता\", \"वोटर आईडी\", \"मतदाता सूची\", \"matdata\", \"vote registration\"]','en',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14','ECI Voter Citizen Services','Election Commission of India ke Citizen Service Portal par new voter registration, electoral roll search, application tracking, aur correction/update requests milti hain. Apni request se match karta form choose karein aur portal ke current instructions padhein.',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(16,'voter_services','निर्वाचन आयोग की मतदाता सेवाएँ','general_scheme','भारत निर्वाचन आयोग का नागरिक पोर्टल नया मतदाता पंजीकरण, मतदाता सूची में नाम खोजना, आवेदन की स्थिति देखना और प्रविष्टि में सुधार या अपडेट के अनुरोध जैसी सेवाएँ देता है। अनुरोध के अनुसार फॉर्म बदलता है; पोर्टल के वर्तमान निर्देश देखें।',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://voters.eci.gov.in/','[\"voter\", \"voter id\", \"voter registration\", \"voter card\", \"electoral roll\", \"epic\", \"eci\", \"मतदाता\", \"वोटर आईडी\", \"मतदाता सूची\", \"matdata\", \"vote registration\"]','hi',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(17,'digilocker','DigiLocker Digital Documents','general_scheme','DigiLocker is a MeitY initiative that gives citizens access to digital documents issued by participating organizations and supports retrieving, sharing, and verifying them. Availability depends on the issuing organization. Check the official DigiLocker service and the receiving department’s rules for a specific application.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.digilocker.gov.in/','[\"digilocker\", \"digi locker\", \"digital locker\", \"digital documents\", \"document wallet\", \"डिजिलॉकर\", \"डिजिटल दस्तावेज़\", \"digilocker document\"]','en',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14','DigiLocker Digital Documents','DigiLocker par participating issuers ke available digital documents access, retrieve, share, aur verify kiye ja sakte hain. Koi particular document available hai ya nahi, yeh uske issuer par depend karta hai. Specific service ke liye receiving authority ke rules check karein.',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(18,'digilocker','डिजिलॉकर के डिजिटल दस्तावेज़','general_scheme','डिजिलॉकर MeitY की पहल है, जो नागरिकों को भाग लेने वाले जारीकर्ता संगठनों के डिजिटल दस्तावेज़ देखने, प्राप्त करने, साझा करने और सत्यापित करने की सुविधा देती है। दस्तावेज़ की उपलब्धता जारीकर्ता संगठन पर निर्भर करती है। किसी आवेदन के लिए डिजिलॉकर और संबंधित विभाग के नियम देखें।',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.digilocker.gov.in/','[\"digilocker\", \"digi locker\", \"digital locker\", \"digital documents\", \"document wallet\", \"डिजिलॉकर\", \"डिजिटल दस्तावेज़\", \"digilocker document\"]','hi',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(19,'umang','UMANG Government Services App','general_scheme','UMANG is developed by MeitY and NeGD as a single platform for accessing participating Central, State, and local e-Government services through its website and app. Each service’s information and transaction rules remain with the responsible department. Check UMANG for service availability and the linked department for requirements.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.umang.gov.in/landing/aboutus','[\"umang\", \"umang app\", \"umang services\", \"unified mobile application\", \"उमंग\", \"उमंग ऐप\", \"umang me seva\"]','en',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14','UMANG Government Services','UMANG, MeitY/NeGD ka platform hai jahan website aur app se participating Central, State, aur local e-Government services access ki ja sakti hain. Available services UMANG par check karein; eligibility aur transactions ke liye service owner ke instructions follow karein.',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(20,'umang','उमंग सरकारी सेवा ऐप','general_scheme','UMANG को MeitY और NeGD ने केंद्र, राज्य तथा स्थानीय ई-सरकारी सेवाओं तक पहुँच के लिए एक मंच के रूप में विकसित किया है। प्रत्येक सेवा की जानकारी और लेन-देन के नियम संबंधित विभाग के पास रहते हैं। सेवा उपलब्धता UMANG पर और आवश्यकताएँ संबंधित विभाग से जाँचें।',NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://www.umang.gov.in/landing/aboutus','[\"umang\", \"umang app\", \"umang services\", \"unified mobile application\", \"उमंग\", \"उमंग ऐप\", \"umang me seva\"]','hi',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL);

CREATE TABLE `faqs` (
  `id` bigint unsigned NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,
  `question` text COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci NOT NULL,
  `answer` text COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci NOT NULL,
  `category` varchar(255) COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci NOT NULL,
  `official_source_url` varchar(255) COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci DEFAULT NULL,
  `keywords` json DEFAULT NULL,
  `language` varchar(5) COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci NOT NULL DEFAULT 'en',
  `is_active` tinyint(1) NOT NULL DEFAULT '1',
  `created_at` timestamp NULL DEFAULT NULL,
  `updated_at` timestamp NULL DEFAULT NULL,
  `question_hinglish` text COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci,
  `answer_hinglish` text COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci,
  PRIMARY KEY (`id`),
  KEY `faqs_category_index` (`category`),
  KEY `faqs_language_index` (`language`),
  KEY `faqs_is_active_index` (`is_active`)
) ENGINE=InnoDB AUTO_INCREMENT=31 DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_unicode_ci;

INSERT INTO `faqs` VALUES 
(1,'Is this an official government website?','No. SevaSetu is an informational academic project. It does not submit applications, verify identity, or approve benefits, and it does not represent a government department. Use the linked official source for current requirements and decisions.','about',NULL,'[\"is this official\", \"official website\", \"government website\", \"about this chatbot\"]','en',1,'2026-11-07 11:16:05','2026-11-07 12:44:14','Kya yeh official government website hai?','Nahi. SevaSetu ek informational academic project hai. Yeh applications submit, identity verify, ya benefits approve nahi karta aur kisi government department ko represent nahi karta. Current requirements aur decisions ke liye linked official source use karein.'),
(2,'क्या यह सरकारी वेबसाइट है?','नहीं। SevaSetu एक सूचनात्मक शैक्षणिक परियोजना है। यह आवेदन जमा, पहचान सत्यापित या लाभ स्वीकृत नहीं करती और किसी सरकारी विभाग का प्रतिनिधित्व नहीं करती। वर्तमान आवश्यकताओं और निर्णयों के लिए जुड़े आधिकारिक स्रोत का उपयोग करें।','about',NULL,'[\"क्या यह आधिकारिक है\", \"सरकारी वेबसाइट\", \"इस चैटबॉट के बारे में\"]','hi',1,'2026-11-07 11:16:05','2026-11-07 12:44:14',NULL,NULL),
(3,'Do I need a new PAN because of PAN 2.0?','No. The Government’s PAN 2.0 FAQ says existing PAN holders do not need to apply for a new PAN under the upgraded system, and existing valid PANs remain valid.','pan_card','https://static.pib.gov.in/WriteReadData/specificdocs/documents/2024/nov/doc20241127454301.pdf','[\"existing pan\", \"pan 2.0\", \"old pan card\", \"new pan number\", \"purana pan\", \"mera pan\", \"पुराना पैन\", \"पैन 2.0\", \"मौजूदा पैन\"]','en',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14','Kya PAN 2.0 ke liye naya PAN lena padega?','Nahi. Government ke PAN 2.0 FAQ ke mutabik existing PAN holders ko upgraded system ke liye naya PAN apply karne ki zaroorat nahi hai, aur existing valid PAN valid rehte hain.'),
(4,'क्या PAN 2.0 के कारण नया पैन बनवाना होगा?','नहीं। सरकार के PAN 2.0 FAQ के अनुसार मौजूदा पैन धारकों को नई प्रणाली के कारण नया पैन लेने की ज़रूरत नहीं है और मौजूदा वैध पैन वैध रहते हैं।','pan_card','https://static.pib.gov.in/WriteReadData/specificdocs/documents/2024/nov/doc20241127454301.pdf','[\"existing pan\", \"pan 2.0\", \"old pan card\", \"new pan number\", \"purana pan\", \"mera pan\", \"पुराना पैन\", \"पैन 2.0\", \"मौजूदा पैन\"]','hi',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14',NULL,NULL),
(5,'Which form should I use for a new PAN application?','For a new PAN allotment application filed on or after 1 April 2026, the Income Tax Department says to use the forms prescribed under the Income Tax Rules, 2026. Check the Department’s current forms page before applying; do not rely on an older form number.','pan_card','https://www.incometax.gov.in/iec/foportal/help/all-topics/e-filing-services/income-tax-forms','[\"new pan application\", \"apply for pan\", \"pan form\", \"naya pan\", \"pan kaise banaye\", \"pan ke liye apply\", \"नया पैन\", \"पैन आवेदन\", \"पैन फॉर्म\"]','en',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14','New PAN application ke liye kaunsa form use karun?','1 April 2026 ya uske baad file ki gayi new PAN allotment application ke liye Income Tax Department, Income Tax Rules, 2026 mein prescribed forms use karne ko kehta hai. Apply karne se pehle Department ka current forms page check karein; purane form number par rely na karein.'),
(6,'नए पैन आवेदन के लिए कौन सा फॉर्म इस्तेमाल करें?','1 अप्रैल 2026 या उसके बाद नए पैन आवंटन के आवेदन के लिए आयकर विभाग आयकर नियम, 2026 में निर्धारित फॉर्म इस्तेमाल करने को कहता है। आवेदन से पहले विभाग का वर्तमान फॉर्म पृष्ठ देखें; पुराने फॉर्म नंबर पर निर्भर न रहें।','pan_card','https://www.incometax.gov.in/iec/foportal/help/all-topics/e-filing-services/income-tax-forms','[\"new pan application\", \"apply for pan\", \"pan form\", \"naya pan\", \"pan kaise banaye\", \"pan ke liye apply\", \"नया पैन\", \"पैन आवेदन\", \"पैन फॉर्म\"]','hi',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14',NULL,NULL),
(7,'How do I apply for a ration card?','Ration-card issuance and beneficiary identification are handled by the State/UT government. Use the NFSA apply page to open your State/UT Food Portal and follow its current instructions. The process is not identical across India.','ration_card','https://nfsa.gov.in/portal/apply','[\"apply ration card\", \"new ration card\", \"ration card application\", \"ration card apply\", \"rashan card apply\", \"ration card ke liye\", \"नया राशन कार्ड\", \"राशन कार्ड आवेदन\", \"राशन कार्ड के लिए\", \"राशन कार्ड बनवाना\"]','en',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14','Ration card ke liye apply kahan aur kaise karun?','Ration card issue karna aur beneficiaries identify karna State/UT government ka kaam hai. NFSA apply page kholkar apna State/UT Food Portal select karein aur uske current instructions follow karein. India bhar mein process same nahi hota.'),
(8,'राशन कार्ड के लिए आवेदन कहाँ करें?','राशन कार्ड जारी करना और लाभार्थियों की पहचान राज्य/केंद्रशासित प्रदेश सरकार करती है। NFSA के आवेदन पृष्ठ से अपना राज्य/केंद्रशासित प्रदेश खाद्य पोर्टल खोलें और उसके वर्तमान निर्देश देखें। पूरे भारत में प्रक्रिया एक जैसी नहीं है।','ration_card','https://nfsa.gov.in/portal/apply','[\"apply ration card\", \"new ration card\", \"ration card application\", \"ration card apply\", \"rashan card apply\", \"ration card ke liye\", \"नया राशन कार्ड\", \"राशन कार्ड आवेदन\", \"राशन कार्ड के लिए\", \"राशन कार्ड बनवाना\"]','hi',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14',NULL,NULL),
(9,'Are ration-card eligibility rules and documents the same in every State?','No. NFSA states that each State/UT identifies eligible households and frames its own criteria. Check your State/UT Food Portal for its eligibility, document list, and process; this catalogue cannot give one universal checklist.','ration_card','https://www.nfsa.gov.in/portal/Ration_Card_State_Portals_','[\"ration card eligibility\", \"ration card documents\", \"ration card rules\", \"state ration card\", \"ration card in my state\", \"rashan card niyam\", \"राज्य के नियम\", \"राशन कार्ड पात्रता\", \"राशन कार्ड दस्तावेज़\"]','en',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14','Kya ration card ki eligibility aur documents har State mein same hote hain?','Nahi. NFSA ke mutabik har State/UT eligible households identify karta hai aur apne criteria banata hai. Eligibility, documents list, aur process ke liye apna State/UT Food Portal check karein; ek universal checklist nahi hai.'),
(10,'क्या हर राज्य में राशन कार्ड की पात्रता और दस्तावेज़ एक जैसे हैं?','नहीं। NFSA के अनुसार पात्र परिवारों की पहचान और अपने मानदंड तय करना हर राज्य/केंद्रशासित प्रदेश की जिम्मेदारी है। पात्रता, दस्तावेज़ सूची और प्रक्रिया के लिए अपना खाद्य पोर्टल देखें; यहाँ एक सार्वभौमिक सूची नहीं दी जा सकती।','ration_card','https://www.nfsa.gov.in/portal/Ration_Card_State_Portals_','[\"ration card eligibility\", \"ration card documents\", \"ration card rules\", \"state ration card\", \"ration card in my state\", \"rashan card niyam\", \"राज्य के नियम\", \"राशन कार्ड पात्रता\", \"राशन कार्ड दस्तावेज़\"]','hi',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14',NULL,NULL),
(11,'How much support does PM-KISAN provide?','The official PM-KISAN portal describes income support of ₹6,000 per year in three equal instalments for eligible landholding farmer families. Scheme exclusions apply, and State/UT governments identify eligible families.','pm_kisan','https://pmkisan.gov.in/','[\"pm kisan amount\", \"pm kisan benefit\", \"pm kisan installments\", \"pm kisan paisa\", \"pm kisan kitna\", \"कितना पैसा\", \"कितनी किस्त\", \"किसान लाभ राशि\"]','en',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14','PM-KISAN mein kitni financial support milti hai?','Official PM-KISAN portal ke mutabik eligible landholding farmer families ko saal ke ₹6,000 teen equal instalments mein milte hain. Scheme exclusions apply hote hain aur eligible families State/UT governments identify karti hain.'),
(12,'पीएम-किसान में कितनी सहायता मिलती है?','आधिकारिक पीएम-किसान पोर्टल पात्र भूमिधारक किसान परिवारों के लिए सालाना ₹6,000 की सहायता तीन समान किस्तों में बताता है। योजना की अपवर्जन श्रेणियाँ लागू हैं और पात्र परिवारों की पहचान राज्य/केंद्रशासित प्रदेश सरकारें करती हैं।','pm_kisan','https://pmkisan.gov.in/','[\"pm kisan amount\", \"pm kisan benefit\", \"pm kisan installments\", \"pm kisan paisa\", \"pm kisan kitna\", \"कितना पैसा\", \"कितनी किस्त\", \"किसान लाभ राशि\"]','hi',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14',NULL,NULL),
(13,'How can I check PM-KISAN status and e-KYC information?','Use the PM-KISAN portal’s Know Your Status service for beneficiary details. The portal currently says e-KYC is mandatory for registered farmers; check the portal for the available method and current status for your case.','pm_kisan','https://pmkisan.gov.in/','[\"pm kisan status\", \"status\", \"kys\", \"pm kisan ekyc\", \"check pm kisan\", \"pm kisan ka status\", \"pm kisan e-kyc\", \"स्थिति\", \"ई-केवाईसी\", \"पैसा आया\"]','en',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14','PM-KISAN status aur e-KYC details kaise check karun?','Beneficiary details ke liye PM-KISAN portal par Know Your Status service use karein. Portal abhi registered farmers ke liye e-KYC mandatory batata hai; apne case ka current status aur available method portal par check karein.'),
(14,'पीएम-किसान की स्थिति और e-KYC जानकारी कैसे देखें?','लाभार्थी की जानकारी के लिए पीएम-किसान पोर्टल की Know Your Status सेवा देखें। पोर्टल वर्तमान में पंजीकृत किसानों के लिए e-KYC अनिवार्य बताता है; अपने मामले की स्थिति और उपलब्ध तरीका पोर्टल पर जाँचें।','pm_kisan','https://pmkisan.gov.in/','[\"pm kisan status\", \"status\", \"kys\", \"pm kisan ekyc\", \"check pm kisan\", \"pm kisan ka status\", \"pm kisan e-kyc\", \"स्थिति\", \"ई-केवाईसी\", \"पैसा आया\"]','hi',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14',NULL,NULL),
(15,'Where can I check scholarship schemes and eligibility?','The National Scholarship Portal lists schemes with their own specifications, FAQs, eligibility, and timelines. Open the particular scheme on NSP and read its current guidelines; eligibility is not the same for every scholarship.','scholarship','https://scholarships.gov.in/All-Scholarships','[\"find scholarship\", \"scholarship eligibility\", \"scholarships on nsp\", \"student scholarship scheme\", \"scholarship kaise milegi\", \"छात्रवृत्ति खोजें\", \"कौन सी छात्रवृत्ति\", \"छात्रवृत्ति पात्रता\"]','en',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14','Scholarship schemes aur eligibility kahan check karun?','National Scholarship Portal par schemes ki apni specifications, FAQs, eligibility, aur timelines listed hain. NSP par specific scheme open karke uski current guidelines padhein; har scholarship ki eligibility same nahi hoti.'),
(16,'छात्रवृत्ति योजनाएँ और पात्रता कहाँ देखें?','राष्ट्रीय छात्रवृत्ति पोर्टल पर योजनाओं के विनिर्देश, FAQ, पात्रता और समय-सारणी दी जाती है। NSP पर संबंधित योजना खोलकर उसके वर्तमान दिशा-निर्देश पढ़ें; हर छात्रवृत्ति की पात्रता एक जैसी नहीं होती।','scholarship','https://scholarships.gov.in/All-Scholarships','[\"find scholarship\", \"scholarship eligibility\", \"scholarships on nsp\", \"student scholarship scheme\", \"scholarship kaise milegi\", \"छात्रवृत्ति खोजें\", \"कौन सी छात्रवृत्ति\", \"छात्रवृत्ति पात्रता\"]','hi',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14',NULL,NULL),
(17,'Does OTR registration mean my scholarship application is submitted?','No. NSP says One Time Registration is required, but generating an OTR does not itself count as a scholarship application. Apply separately to a scheme when its application window is open and follow that scheme’s instructions.','scholarship','https://scholarships.gov.in/otrapplication/','[\"otr\", \"scholarship application\", \"otr application\", \"is otr application\", \"apply scholarship nsp\", \"छात्रवृत्ति आवेदन\", \"ओटीआर\", \"scholarship form\"]','en',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14','Kya OTR registration se scholarship application submit ho jati hai?','Nahi. NSP par One Time Registration zaroori hai, lekin OTR generate karna apne aap scholarship application submit karna nahi hota. Scheme ki application window open hone par uske liye alag se apply karein aur us scheme ke instructions follow karein.'),
(18,'क्या OTR बनने से छात्रवृत्ति का आवेदन जमा हो जाता है?','नहीं। NSP के अनुसार One Time Registration आवश्यक है, लेकिन OTR बनना अपने-आप छात्रवृत्ति आवेदन नहीं है। योजना की आवेदन अवधि खुलने पर अलग से आवेदन करें और उसी योजना के निर्देश मानें।','scholarship','https://scholarships.gov.in/otrapplication/','[\"otr\", \"scholarship application\", \"otr application\", \"is otr application\", \"apply scholarship nsp\", \"छात्रवृत्ति आवेदन\", \"ओटीआर\", \"scholarship form\"]','hi',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14',NULL,NULL),
(19,'Which documents are needed for an Aadhaar update?','The acceptable supporting documents depend on what is being enrolled or updated. Use UIDAI’s current acceptable-document list and guidance for the exact service; this chatbot does not provide a universal document checklist.','aadhaar','https://uidai.gov.in/en/enrolment-and-updates','[\"aadhaar update documents\", \"aadhaar acceptable documents\", \"aadhaar address update document\", \"aadhar documents\", \"aadhaar me kya update\", \"आधार अपडेट दस्तावेज़\", \"आधार में सुधार\", \"आधार के दस्तावेज़\"]','en',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14','Aadhaar update ke liye kaun se documents chahiye?','Acceptable supporting documents is baat par depend karte hain ki kaunsi detail enrol ya update karni hai. Exact service ke liye UIDAI ki current acceptable-document list aur guidance use karein; ek universal document checklist nahi hai.'),
(20,'आधार अपडेट के लिए कौन से दस्तावेज़ चाहिए?','स्वीकार्य दस्तावेज़ इस बात पर निर्भर करते हैं कि कौन-सी जानकारी दर्ज या अपडेट करनी है। संबंधित सेवा के लिए UIDAI की वर्तमान स्वीकार्य दस्तावेज़ सूची और निर्देश देखें; यहाँ एक सार्वभौमिक सूची नहीं दी जाती।','aadhaar','https://uidai.gov.in/en/enrolment-and-updates','[\"aadhaar update documents\", \"aadhaar acceptable documents\", \"aadhaar address update document\", \"aadhar documents\", \"aadhaar me kya update\", \"आधार अपडेट दस्तावेज़\", \"आधार में सुधार\", \"आधार के दस्तावेज़\"]','hi',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14',NULL,NULL),
(21,'Where can I enrol for Aadhaar or update Aadhaar details?','UIDAI’s Aadhaar Seva Kendra page lists enrolment and update services and offers centre and appointment information. Check the page for the service you need and the current centre details before visiting.','aadhaar','https://uidai.gov.in/en/aadhaar-seva-kendra','[\"aadhaar enrolment centre\", \"aadhaar seva kendra\", \"where update aadhaar\", \"uidai center\", \"आधार सेवा केंद्र\", \"आधार केंद्र\", \"नामांकन केंद्र\", \"aadhaar center\"]','en',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14','Aadhaar enrolment ya details update kahan karwa sakta hoon?','UIDAI ke Aadhaar Seva Kendra page par enrolment aur update services ke saath centre aur appointment information milti hai. Jaane se pehle apni service aur centre ki current details check karein.'),
(22,'आधार नामांकन या अपडेट कहाँ कराएँ?','UIDAI का आधार सेवा केंद्र पृष्ठ नामांकन और अपडेट सेवाएँ तथा केंद्र और अपॉइंटमेंट की जानकारी देता है। जाने से पहले अपनी सेवा और केंद्र का वर्तमान विवरण उस पृष्ठ पर देखें।','aadhaar','https://uidai.gov.in/en/aadhaar-seva-kendra','[\"aadhaar enrolment centre\", \"aadhaar seva kendra\", \"where update aadhaar\", \"uidai center\", \"आधार सेवा केंद्र\", \"आधार केंद्र\", \"नामांकन केंद्र\", \"aadhaar center\"]','hi',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14',NULL,NULL),
(23,'What is the official process for a fresh or reissue passport?','Passport Seva’s published process is to register online, complete and submit the application, pay the applicable fee, schedule an appointment, and visit a PSK/POPSK with the documents listed for that service. Check the current document advisory and fee calculator; requirements vary by service.','general_scheme','https://passportindia.gov.in/psp/apply','[\"passport seva\", \"passport apply\", \"new passport\", \"passport reissue\", \"passport appointment\", \"passport kaise banaye\", \"पासपोर्ट आवेदन\", \"पासपोर्ट सेवा\", \"नया पासपोर्ट\"]','en',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14','Fresh ya reissue passport ka official process kya hai?','Passport Seva ke published process mein online registration, application complete karke submit karna, applicable fee pay karna, appointment schedule karna, aur listed documents ke saath PSK/POPSK visit karna shamil hai. Current document advisory aur fee calculator check karein; requirements service ke hisaab se badalti hain.'),
(24,'नए या पुनः जारी पासपोर्ट की आधिकारिक प्रक्रिया क्या है?','पासपोर्ट सेवा की प्रकाशित प्रक्रिया में ऑनलाइन पंजीकरण, आवेदन भरना और जमा करना, लागू शुल्क देना, अपॉइंटमेंट लेना तथा सेवा के लिए सूचीबद्ध दस्तावेज़ों के साथ PSK/POPSK जाना शामिल है। वर्तमान दस्तावेज़ निर्देश और शुल्क कैलकुलेटर देखें; आवश्यकताएँ सेवा के अनुसार बदलती हैं।','general_scheme','https://passportindia.gov.in/psp/apply','[\"passport seva\", \"passport apply\", \"new passport\", \"passport reissue\", \"passport appointment\", \"पासपोर्ट आवेदन\", \"पासपोर्ट सेवा\", \"नया पासपोर्ट\"]','hi',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14',NULL,NULL),
(25,'Where do I register as a voter or correct voter details?','Use the Election Commission of India’s Citizen Service Portal. It provides new registration, electoral-roll search, application tracking, and correction/update requests. Select the portal form that matches your request and read its current instructions.','general_scheme','https://voters.eci.gov.in/','[\"voter registration\", \"voter id correction\", \"voter card\", \"eci voter portal\", \"voter list\", \"matdata\", \"मतदाता पंजीकरण\", \"वोटर आईडी\", \"वोटर कार्ड\", \"मतदाता सूची\"]','en',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14','Voter registration ya voter details correct kahan karun?','Election Commission of India ka Citizen Service Portal use karein. Wahan new registration, electoral roll search, application tracking, aur correction/update requests milti hain. Apni request ke hisaab se form select karein aur current instructions padhein.'),
(26,'मतदाता पंजीकरण या विवरण में सुधार कहाँ करें?','भारत निर्वाचन आयोग का नागरिक सेवा पोर्टल इस्तेमाल करें। वहाँ नया पंजीकरण, मतदाता सूची में नाम खोजना, आवेदन की स्थिति और सुधार/अपडेट के अनुरोध उपलब्ध हैं। अपने अनुरोध के अनुसार फॉर्म चुनें और वर्तमान निर्देश पढ़ें।','general_scheme','https://voters.eci.gov.in/','[\"voter registration\", \"voter id correction\", \"voter card\", \"eci voter portal\", \"voter list\", \"matdata\", \"मतदाता पंजीकरण\", \"वोटर आईडी\", \"वोटर कार्ड\", \"मतदाता सूची\"]','hi',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14',NULL,NULL),
(27,'What can I do with DigiLocker?','DigiLocker lets citizens access, retrieve, share, and verify digital documents made available by participating issuers. Whether a particular document is available depends on its issuer; check the receiving authority’s rules for a specific service.','general_scheme','https://www.digilocker.gov.in/','[\"digilocker\", \"digi locker\", \"digital locker\", \"digital documents\", \"document wallet\", \"डिजिलॉकर\", \"डिजिटल दस्तावेज़\", \"digilocker documents\"]','en',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14','DigiLocker par kya kar sakta hoon?','DigiLocker participating issuers ke available digital documents access, retrieve, share, aur verify karne deta hai. Koi specific document available hoga ya nahi, yeh issuer par depend karta hai; kisi service ke liye receiving authority ke rules check karein.'),
(28,'डिजिलॉकर से क्या कर सकते हैं?','डिजिलॉकर भाग लेने वाले जारीकर्ताओं द्वारा उपलब्ध कराए गए डिजिटल दस्तावेज़ देखने, प्राप्त करने, साझा करने और सत्यापित करने देता है। कोई खास दस्तावेज़ उपलब्ध होगा या नहीं यह जारीकर्ता पर निर्भर करता है; संबंधित सेवा के लिए विभाग के नियम देखें।','general_scheme','https://www.digilocker.gov.in/','[\"digilocker\", \"digi locker\", \"digital locker\", \"digital documents\", \"document wallet\", \"डिजिलॉकर\", \"डिजिटल दस्तावेज़\", \"digilocker documents\"]','hi',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14',NULL,NULL),
(29,'What is UMANG and where can I find its services?','UMANG is a MeitY/NeGD platform for accessing participating Central, State, and local e-Government services through its website and app. Check UMANG for available services, then follow the service owner’s instructions for eligibility and transactions.','general_scheme','https://www.umang.gov.in/landing/aboutus','[\"umang app\", \"umang services\", \"umang government\", \"umang me seva\", \"उमंग ऐप\", \"उमंग सेवाएँ\", \"umang\"]','en',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14','UMANG kya hai aur iski services kahan milengi?','UMANG, MeitY/NeGD ka platform hai jahan website aur app se participating Central, State, aur local e-Government services access hoti hain. Available services UMANG par check karein; eligibility ya transactions ke liye service owner ke instructions follow karein.'),
(30,'UMANG क्या है और इसकी सेवाएँ कहाँ मिलेंगी?','UMANG, MeitY/NeGD का मंच है जहाँ वेबसाइट और ऐप से भाग लेने वाली केंद्र, राज्य और स्थानीय ई-सरकारी सेवाएँ मिलती हैं। उपलब्ध सेवाएँ UMANG पर देखें और पात्रता या लेन-देन के लिए सेवा देने वाले विभाग के निर्देश मानें।','general_scheme','https://www.umang.gov.in/landing/aboutus','[\"umang app\", \"umang services\", \"umang government\", \"umang me seva\", \"उमंग ऐप\", \"उमंग सेवाएँ\", \"umang\"]','hi',1,'2026-11-07 12:44:14','2026-11-07 12:44:14',NULL,NULL);

CREATE TABLE `chat_histories` (
  `id` bigint unsigned NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,
  `user_id` bigint unsigned DEFAULT NULL,
  `matched_scheme_id` bigint unsigned DEFAULT NULL,
  `matched_faq_id` bigint unsigned DEFAULT NULL,
  `session_id` varchar(100) COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci DEFAULT NULL,
  `query` text COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci NOT NULL,
  `response` text COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci NOT NULL,
  `intent` varchar(40) COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci DEFAULT NULL,
  `language` varchar(10) COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci NOT NULL DEFAULT 'en',
  `confidence_score` decimal(6,5) DEFAULT NULL,
  `created_at` timestamp NULL DEFAULT NULL,
  `updated_at` timestamp NULL DEFAULT NULL,
  PRIMARY KEY (`id`),
  KEY `chat_histories_user_id_foreign` (`user_id`),
  KEY `chat_histories_matched_scheme_id_foreign` (`matched_scheme_id`),
  KEY `chat_histories_matched_faq_id_foreign` (`matched_faq_id`),
  KEY `chat_histories_session_id_index` (`session_id`),
  KEY `chat_histories_intent_index` (`intent`),
  KEY `chat_histories_language_index` (`language`),
  CONSTRAINT `chat_histories_matched_faq_id_foreign` FOREIGN KEY (`matched_faq_id`) REFERENCES `faqs` (`id`) ON DELETE SET NULL,
  CONSTRAINT `chat_histories_matched_scheme_id_foreign` FOREIGN KEY (`matched_scheme_id`) REFERENCES `schemes` (`id`) ON DELETE SET NULL,
  CONSTRAINT `chat_histories_user_id_foreign` FOREIGN KEY (`user_id`) REFERENCES `users` (`id`) ON DELETE SET NULL
) ENGINE=InnoDB AUTO_INCREMENT=29 DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_unicode_ci;

INSERT INTO `chat_histories` VALUES 
(1,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,'Tell me about Aadhaar','Demo catalogue entry for Aadhaar Card. Verified eligibility, document lists, application steps, and an official source have not been added. Administrators should review and publish official information before citizens rely on it.\n\nThis catalogue entry is demo content and has not been verified against an official source.','aadhaar','en',NULL,'2026-11-07 11:23:33','2026-11-07 11:23:33'),
(2,NULL,9,NULL,NULL,'I am searching for an education grant','Demo catalogue entry for Government Scholarships. Verified eligibility, document lists, application steps, and an official source have not been added. Administrators should review and publish official information before citizens rely on it.\n\nThis catalogue entry is demo content and has not been verified against an official source.','scholarship','en',0.49480,'2026-11-07 11:23:33','2026-11-07 11:23:33'),
(3,2,3,NULL,'6UqltyNQtzi4AZfIjSTiIuSm2qL0D80eS3Zuzfiv','How can I apply for a PAN card?','Demo catalogue entry for PAN Card. Verified eligibility, document lists, application steps, and an official source have not been added. Administrators should review and publish official information before citizens rely on it.\n\nThis catalogue entry is demo content and has not been verified against an official source.','pan_card','en',NULL,'2026-11-07 11:53:45','2026-11-07 11:53:45'),
(4,2,5,NULL,'6UqltyNQtzi4AZfIjSTiIuSm2qL0D80eS3Zuzfiv','मुझे राशन कार्ड के लिए आवेदन करना है।','Demo catalogue entry for Ration Card. Verified eligibility, document lists, application steps, and an official source have not been added. Administrators should review and publish official information before citizens rely on it.\n\nThis catalogue entry is demo content and has not been verified against an official source.','ration_card','en',NULL,'2026-11-07 11:55:35','2026-11-07 11:55:35'),
(5,2,7,NULL,'6UqltyNQtzi4AZfIjSTiIuSm2qL0D80eS3Zuzfiv','PM Kisan ka paisa kaise milega?','Demo catalogue entry for PM-Kisan. Verified eligibility, document lists, application steps, and an official source have not been added. Administrators should review and publish official information before citizens rely on it.\n\nThis catalogue entry is demo content and has not been verified against an official source.','pm_kisan','en',NULL,'2026-11-07 11:55:44','2026-11-07 11:55:44'),
(6,2,3,NULL,'T0Zbi5KRtSqds22RFqnVZIuQBsgYCj3aGurM4ifg','PAN Card','The Income Tax Department publishes current PAN allotment forms and PAN-related services. For a new PAN allotment application filed on or after 1 April 2026, the Department says to use the forms prescribed under the Income Tax Rules, 2026. Existing valid PANs remain valid; check the official page for the current form and service before applying.\n\nPlease confirm current details with the official source before taking action.','pan_card','en',NULL,'2026-11-08 00:59:48','2026-11-08 00:59:48'),
(7,2,7,NULL,'T0Zbi5KRtSqds22RFqnVZIuQBsgYCj3aGurM4ifg','PM-Kisan','PM-KISAN is a Central Sector scheme that provides ₹6,000 per year in three equal instalments to eligible landholding farmer families, subject to the scheme’s exclusion categories. State/UT governments identify eligible families. The official portal provides registration, beneficiary-status, and current e-KYC information; check it for your case.\n\nPlease confirm current details with the official source before taking action.','pm_kisan','en',NULL,'2026-11-08 01:00:06','2026-11-08 01:00:06'),
(8,2,NULL,7,'T0Zbi5KRtSqds22RFqnVZIuQBsgYCj3aGurM4ifg','मुझे राशन कार्ड के लिए आवेदन करना है।','Ration-card issuance and beneficiary identification are handled by the State/UT government. Use the NFSA apply page to open your State/UT Food Portal and follow its current instructions. The process is not identical across India.','ration_card','en',NULL,'2026-11-08 01:00:17','2026-11-08 01:00:17'),
(9,2,7,NULL,'T0Zbi5KRtSqds22RFqnVZIuQBsgYCj3aGurM4ifg','PM Kisan ka paisa kaise milega?','PM-KISAN is a Central Sector scheme that provides ₹6,000 per year in three equal instalments to eligible landholding farmer families, subject to the scheme’s exclusion categories. State/UT governments identify eligible families. The official portal provides registration, beneficiary-status, and current e-KYC information; check it for your case.\n\nPlease confirm current details with the official source before taking action.','pm_kisan','en',NULL,'2026-11-08 01:00:39','2026-11-08 01:00:39'),
(10,2,8,NULL,'T0Zbi5KRtSqds22RFqnVZIuQBsgYCj3aGurM4ifg','PM Kisan ka paisa kaise milega?','पीएम-किसान केंद्र क्षेत्र की योजना है। योजना की अपवर्जन श्रेणियों के अधीन पात्र भूमिधारक किसान परिवारों को सालाना ₹6,000 तीन समान किस्तों में दिए जाते हैं। पात्र परिवारों की पहचान राज्य/केंद्रशासित प्रदेश सरकारें करती हैं। पंजीकरण, लाभार्थी स्थिति और वर्तमान e-KYC जानकारी के लिए आधिकारिक पोर्टल देखें।\n\nPlease confirm current details with the official source before taking action.','pm_kisan','hi',NULL,'2026-11-08 01:13:43','2026-11-08 01:13:43'),
(11,2,NULL,8,'T0Zbi5KRtSqds22RFqnVZIuQBsgYCj3aGurM4ifg','मुझे राशन कार्ड के लिए आवेदन करना है।','राशन कार्ड जारी करना और लाभार्थियों की पहचान राज्य/केंद्रशासित प्रदेश सरकार करती है। NFSA के आवेदन पृष्ठ से अपना राज्य/केंद्रशासित प्रदेश खाद्य पोर्टल खोलें और उसके वर्तमान निर्देश देखें। पूरे भारत में प्रक्रिया एक जैसी नहीं है।','ration_card','hi',NULL,'2026-11-08 01:13:59','2026-11-08 01:13:59'),
(12,2,3,NULL,'T0Zbi5KRtSqds22RFqnVZIuQBsgYCj3aGurM4ifg','how to apply pan card','The Income Tax Department publishes current PAN allotment forms and PAN-related services. For a new PAN allotment application filed on or after 1 April 2026, the Department says to use the forms prescribed under the Income Tax Rules, 2026. Existing valid PANs remain valid; check the official page for the current form and service before applying.\n\nPlease confirm current details with the official source before taking action.','pan_card','en',NULL,'2026-11-08 01:14:18','2026-11-08 01:14:18'),
(13,2,4,NULL,'T0Zbi5KRtSqds22RFqnVZIuQBsgYCj3aGurM4ifg','pan card kaise apply kre','आयकर विभाग पैन आवंटन के वर्तमान फॉर्म और पैन से जुड़ी सेवाओं की जानकारी देता है। 1 अप्रैल 2026 या उसके बाद नए पैन के लिए आवेदन करते समय विभाग के अनुसार आयकर नियम, 2026 में निर्धारित फॉर्म इस्तेमाल करें। मौजूदा वैध पैन वैध रहते हैं; आवेदन से पहले वर्तमान फॉर्म और सेवा की आधिकारिक जानकारी देखें।\n\nPlease confirm current details with the official source before taking action.','pan_card','hi',NULL,'2026-11-08 01:14:38','2026-11-08 01:14:38'),
(14,2,8,NULL,'T0Zbi5KRtSqds22RFqnVZIuQBsgYCj3aGurM4ifg','PM Kisan ka paisa kaise check karu?','पीएम-किसान केंद्र क्षेत्र की योजना है। योजना की अपवर्जन श्रेणियों के अधीन पात्र भूमिधारक किसान परिवारों को सालाना ₹6,000 तीन समान किस्तों में दिए जाते हैं। पात्र परिवारों की पहचान राज्य/केंद्रशासित प्रदेश सरकारें करती हैं। पंजीकरण, लाभार्थी स्थिति और वर्तमान e-KYC जानकारी के लिए आधिकारिक पोर्टल देखें।\n\nPlease confirm current details with the official source before taking action.','pm_kisan','hi',NULL,'2026-11-08 01:15:37','2026-11-08 01:15:37'),
(15,1,NULL,13,'pJdvM9QuDesWpx3Id9OVdSGiSvw6VC7zeClMACU1','PM Kisan ka status kaise check karu?','Beneficiary details ke liye PM-KISAN portal par Know Your Status service use karein. Portal abhi registered farmers ke liye e-KYC mandatory batata hai; apne case ka current status aur available method portal par check karein.','pm_kisan','hinglish',NULL,'2026-11-08 01:49:45','2026-11-08 01:49:45'),
(16,1,1,NULL,'pJdvM9QuDesWpx3Id9OVdSGiSvw6VC7zeClMACU1','Aadhaar card mein mobile number update kaise karwaye?','UIDAI current Aadhaar enrolment aur update services, forms, aur acceptable-document lists publish karta hai. Documents aur steps service aur applicant type par depend karte hain, isliye apni request ke liye UIDAI ki exact guidance check karein. UIDAI Aadhaar Seva Kendras par enrolment aur update services deta hai.\n\nAction lene se pehle current details official source par confirm karein.','aadhaar','hinglish',NULL,'2026-11-08 01:49:57','2026-11-08 01:49:57'),
(17,1,NULL,13,'pJdvM9QuDesWpx3Id9OVdSGiSvw6VC7zeClMACU1','How can I check my PM-KISAN status?','Use the PM-KISAN portal’s Know Your Status service for beneficiary details. The portal currently says e-KYC is mandatory for registered farmers; check the portal for the available method and current status for your case.','pm_kisan','en',NULL,'2026-11-08 01:50:20','2026-11-08 01:50:20'),
(18,1,8,NULL,'pJdvM9QuDesWpx3Id9OVdSGiSvw6VC7zeClMACU1','मैं अपना पीएम-किसान स्टेटस कैसे चेक करूँ?','पीएम-किसान केंद्र क्षेत्र की योजना है। योजना की अपवर्जन श्रेणियों के अधीन पात्र भूमिधारक किसान परिवारों को सालाना ₹6,000 तीन समान किस्तों में दिए जाते हैं। पात्र परिवारों की पहचान राज्य/केंद्रशासित प्रदेश सरकारें करती हैं। पंजीकरण, लाभार्थी स्थिति और वर्तमान e-KYC जानकारी के लिए आधिकारिक पोर्टल देखें।\n\nPlease confirm current details with the official source before taking action.','pm_kisan','hi',NULL,'2026-11-08 01:50:32','2026-11-08 01:50:32'),
(19,1,NULL,13,'pJdvM9QuDesWpx3Id9OVdSGiSvw6VC7zeClMACU1','How can I check my PM-KISAN status?','Use the PM-KISAN portal’s Know Your Status service for beneficiary details. The portal currently says e-KYC is mandatory for registered farmers; check the portal for the available method and current status for your case.','pm_kisan','en',NULL,'2026-11-08 01:50:49','2026-11-08 01:50:49'),
(20,1,NULL,27,'pJdvM9QuDesWpx3Id9OVdSGiSvw6VC7zeClMACU1','how to use digilocker','DigiLocker lets citizens access, retrieve, share, and verify digital documents made available by participating issuers. Whether a particular document is available depends on its issuer; check the receiving authority’s rules for a specific service.','general_scheme','en',NULL,'2026-11-08 01:51:16','2026-11-08 01:51:16'),
(21,1,3,NULL,'pJdvM9QuDesWpx3Id9OVdSGiSvw6VC7zeClMACU1','PAN Card','The Income Tax Department publishes current PAN allotment forms and PAN-related services. For a new PAN allotment application filed on or after 1 April 2026, the Department says to use the forms prescribed under the Income Tax Rules, 2026. Existing valid PANs remain valid; check the official page for the current form and service before applying.\n\nPlease confirm current details with the official source before taking action.','pan_card','en',NULL,'2026-11-08 01:52:07','2026-11-08 01:52:07'),
(22,1,1,NULL,'pJdvM9QuDesWpx3Id9OVdSGiSvw6VC7zeClMACU1','Aadhaar','UIDAI publishes the current Aadhaar enrolment and update services, forms, and acceptable-document lists. The documents and steps depend on the service and applicant type, so check UIDAI guidance for the exact request. UIDAI Aadhaar Seva Kendras offer enrolment and update services.\n\nPlease confirm current details with the official source before taking action.','aadhaar','en',NULL,'2026-11-08 01:52:12','2026-11-08 01:52:12'),
(23,1,5,NULL,'pJdvM9QuDesWpx3Id9OVdSGiSvw6VC7zeClMACU1','Ration Card','Under the National Food Security Act, the State or Union Territory government identifies eligible households and handles AAY and Priority Household ration-card issuance. Eligibility criteria and application procedures are state-specific. Use the NFSA apply page to select your State/UT food portal; do not assume a single national document list or process.\n\nPlease confirm current details with the official source before taking action.','ration_card','en',NULL,'2026-11-08 01:52:15','2026-11-08 01:52:15'),
(24,1,11,NULL,'pJdvM9QuDesWpx3Id9OVdSGiSvw6VC7zeClMACU1','Schemes','The National Portal of India has a Services section for searching government services and browsing them by category. Start there, then follow the linked ministry, department, or State/UT portal for the service you need. Requirements and processing are set by the responsible department.\n\nPlease confirm current details with the official source before taking action.','general_scheme','en',NULL,'2026-11-08 01:52:19','2026-11-08 01:52:19'),
(25,1,3,NULL,'pJdvM9QuDesWpx3Id9OVdSGiSvw6VC7zeClMACU1','pan card scheme','The Income Tax Department publishes current PAN allotment forms and PAN-related services. For a new PAN allotment application filed on or after 1 April 2026, the Department says to use the forms prescribed under the Income Tax Rules, 2026. Existing valid PANs remain valid; check the official page for the current form and service before applying.\n\nPlease confirm current details with the official source before taking action.','pan_card','en',NULL,'2026-11-08 01:53:00','2026-11-08 01:53:00'),
(26,1,7,NULL,'pJdvM9QuDesWpx3Id9OVdSGiSvw6VC7zeClMACU1','pm-kishan yojn','PM-KISAN is a Central Sector scheme that provides ₹6,000 per year in three equal instalments to eligible landholding farmer families, subject to the scheme’s exclusion categories. State/UT governments identify eligible families. The official portal provides registration, beneficiary-status, and current e-KYC information; check it for your case.\n\nPlease confirm current details with the official source before taking action.','pm_kisan','en',0.60524,'2026-11-08 01:53:37','2026-11-08 01:53:37'),
(27,1,2,NULL,'pJdvM9QuDesWpx3Id9OVdSGiSvw6VC7zeClMACU1','मुझे आधार कार्ड की जानकारी चाहिए।','UIDAI आधार नामांकन और अपडेट सेवाओं, फॉर्म तथा स्वीकार्य दस्तावेज़ों की वर्तमान जानकारी देता है। दस्तावेज़ और चरण सेवा तथा आवेदक के प्रकार के अनुसार बदल सकते हैं, इसलिए अपने अनुरोध के लिए UIDAI की सूची देखें। UIDAI आधार सेवा केंद्र नामांकन और अपडेट सेवाएँ देते हैं।\n\nPlease confirm current details with the official source before taking action.','aadhaar','hi',NULL,'2026-11-08 01:54:45','2026-11-08 01:54:45'),
(28,1,1,NULL,'pJdvM9QuDesWpx3Id9OVdSGiSvw6VC7zeClMACU1','Aadhaar card mein mobile number update kaise karwaye?','UIDAI current Aadhaar enrolment aur update services, forms, aur acceptable-document lists publish karta hai. Documents aur steps service aur applicant type par depend karte hain, isliye apni request ke liye UIDAI ki exact guidance check karein. UIDAI Aadhaar Seva Kendras par enrolment aur update services deta hai.\n\nAction lene se pehle current details official source par confirm karein.','aadhaar','hinglish',NULL,'2026-11-08 01:55:32','2026-11-08 01:55:32');

